"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"AND\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of neurological conditions\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"such as multiple sclerosis, Parkinson's disease, or epilepsy.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"OR\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have a history of other neurological conditions\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"such as peripheral neuropathy, Guillain-Barré syndrome, or myasthenia gravis.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"That, in the opinion of the investigator, would interfere with their ability to participate in the study.\"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Are taking a lidocaine-containing product\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"that could not be discontinued while receiving lidocaine.\"\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"OR\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"Are taking class 1 anti-arrhythmic drugs\"\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"raw_text\": \"such as mexiletine or tocainide.\"